The reimbursement track is denied and no challenge to the denial is on record [[verdict:B-10]]; received is $0.00 [[calc:reimbursement.received_usd]] against expected $84,240.00 [[calc:reimbursement.expected_usd]], a variance of $84,240.00 [[calc:reimbursement.variance_usd]]. The rebate track is fully settled and cash-matched [[verdict:C-08]]. The episode sits at EXCEPTION because a denied reimbursement and a paid 340B rebate coexist — cross-track flag X-1, reason DENIED_WITH_REBATE_PAID — and that combination is what keeps it open rather than terminal [[event:9]].

